#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:1 ad5e89a4a53349ee870d74619370c81f
msgid "Multi-asset / portfolio backtests"
msgstr "多资产 / 投资组合回测"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:3 f77352144dbb4ecd819af3a120f3d919
msgid ""
"QTrade supports portfolio backtests where a single strategy trades "
"multiple assets sharing one cash pool. The single-asset workflow from "
"[Getting Started](getting_started.md) is unchanged — multi-asset is "
"enabled by passing a dict of DataFrames instead of a single one."
msgstr ""
"QTrade 支持投资组合回测：单个策略同时交易多个资产，共用一个现金池。"
"[快速开始](getting_started.md)里的单资产用法保持不变 —— 启用多资产只需要把 "
"DataFrame 换成 dict 传进去。"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:8 507cfb07caf0466ba9d21ce59a9a69b0
msgid "Data"
msgstr "数据"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:10 15447882b0cd4f499a40daac238cb323
msgid ""
"Pass a `dict[str, pd.DataFrame]` keyed by asset symbol. Every DataFrame "
"needs the standard OHLCV columns and **must share an identical "
"`DatetimeIndex`** (align/reindex up-front if your sources don't):"
msgstr ""
"传入一个以资产代码为键的 `dict[str, pd.DataFrame]`。每个 DataFrame 都需要标准的 "
"OHLCV 列，并且**必须共享完全一致的 `DatetimeIndex`**（数据源不一致时请预先对齐 / "
"reindex）："

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:31 11d4b118ce48472b889c5469ae5d6848
msgid ""
"`Backtest` validates each DataFrame independently and raises a clear "
"error if the indexes diverge."
msgstr ""
"`Backtest` 会单独验证每个 DataFrame，如果索引不一致会抛出清晰的错误。"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:34 2820c56a9e5645fbbfe790f864d282c4
msgid "Strategy"
msgstr "策略"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:36 f2bf53a35e904d30948eaefb2c40038e
msgid ""
"In multi-asset mode the strategy must specify which asset each order "
"targets. Iterate `self.assets` and use `self.positions[symbol]` / "
"`self.data_by_asset[symbol]`:"
msgstr ""
"多资产模式下，策略必须指定每个订单针对哪个资产。遍历 `self.assets`，并使用 "
"`self.positions[symbol]` / `self.data_by_asset[symbol]`："

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:68 bb5711c8ce9446ffa7a9b20e334d3c7d
msgid "API overview when running multi-asset:"
msgstr "多资产模式下的 API 速查："

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 504547c1ce79406f94a42367b4cdd8c5
msgid "Single-asset shorthand"
msgstr "单资产简写"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 83208e2a093a4ee6b5af0f9b88d26503
msgid "Multi-asset equivalent"
msgstr "多资产对应写法"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 2fcae2c920024cbfaeacdc51fff35ae9
msgid "`self.buy(size=10)`"
msgstr "`self.buy(size=10)`"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md f81beeeefa394108831e2da38573a5bb
msgid "`self.buy(\"AAPL\", size=10)`"
msgstr "`self.buy(\"AAPL\", size=10)`"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 91a756fe2f4642ca9e02769beabf2cc4
msgid "`self.sell(size=5)`"
msgstr "`self.sell(size=5)`"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 1164224a244444d98f7e8c9e6e6a5843
msgid "`self.sell(\"AAPL\", size=5)`"
msgstr "`self.sell(\"AAPL\", size=5)`"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 495041a35d92449c9d9ef73a729aa03d
msgid "`self.close()`"
msgstr "`self.close()`"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md c72554342f624b15aaa77098571c71ac
msgid "`self.close()` — closes every asset, or `self.close(\"AAPL\")` for one"
msgstr "`self.close()` —— 关掉所有资产；`self.close(\"AAPL\")` 只关一个"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 920ae3ab3c234f44b32753bc802b386d
msgid "`self.position`"
msgstr "`self.position`"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 4e85b5a520234ca4b806ded01b08dc6a
msgid "`self.positions[\"AAPL\"]`"
msgstr "`self.positions[\"AAPL\"]`"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 65b048727cd846c1a8ca488a844d5627
msgid "`self.data`"
msgstr "`self.data`"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md 79e4809245b04f1ab080399f588255b5
msgid "`self.data_by_asset[\"AAPL\"]`"
msgstr "`self.data_by_asset[\"AAPL\"]`"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:78 3ec6167a2426441f86ca676e846088d1
msgid ""
"`self.position` and `self.data` raise `AttributeError` in multi-asset "
"mode with a message pointing at the dict accessor."
msgstr ""
"在多资产模式下，`self.position` 和 `self.data` 会抛出 `AttributeError`，"
"提示信息会指向对应的 dict 访问器。"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:81 9d256fd78a9f4b41a859bcb03e6a8935
msgid "Running it"
msgstr "运行回测"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:100 b35ffb1b935a4a52a6e0c306d60d87ed
msgid ""
"The `Buy & Hold Return [%]` shown in `show_stats()` is the **equal-"
"weighted average** across all assets — a sensible default benchmark for "
"portfolio strategies."
msgstr ""
"`show_stats()` 输出的 `Buy & Hold Return [%]` 是各资产的**等权平均**收益 —— "
"对组合策略而言这是一个合理的默认基准。"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:104 e8d4b855b8a348759992eb9b56331c06
msgid "Per-asset breakdown"
msgstr "按资产拆分"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:106 45a7f78ecdb844b9813f1f65e6f3ee92
msgid "For trade-level statistics on each asset:"
msgstr "查看每个资产的交易级统计："

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:119 6ceb2c87172f496bb65adfa540eb2d89
msgid ""
"Aggregate metrics (Sharpe, Sortino, drawdown, equity curve) are "
"inherently portfolio-wide and only available via "
"`calculate_stats(broker)` — attribution to individual assets requires "
"extra accounting that QTrade intentionally doesn't try to do."
msgstr ""
"组合级指标（Sharpe、Sortino、回撤、净值曲线）本质上是组合范围的，只能通过 "
"`calculate_stats(broker)` 获取 —— 把它们归因到单个资产需要额外的会计逻辑，"
"QTrade 有意不去做这件事。"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:124 7ad831b0f16641e2a1309629db46a1f6
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "可视化"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:126 8c223160e41e49e1a2ed66d7306ecc67
msgid "`bt.plot()` renders a multi-panel layout:"
msgstr "`bt.plot()` 渲染多面板布局："

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:127 c2ea46096acd4d1b88087777eeda9361
msgid ""
"**Top:** portfolio equity vs equal-weighted Buy & Hold (with drawdown "
"overlay)."
msgstr ""
"**顶部**：组合净值 vs 等权 Buy & Hold（叠加回撤区域）。"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:128 52b35787f8ee43ed8062860d30fa8fcb
msgid "**Middle:** trade-returns scatter across all assets."
msgstr "**中部**：所有资产的交易收益散点图。"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:129 167740825109408fb1da9e8ba7d8ab44
msgid ""
"**Bottom:** one OHLC panel per asset, stacked vertically with linked "
"x-axes."
msgstr ""
"**底部**：每个资产一个 OHLC 面板，纵向堆叠，X 轴联动缩放。"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:131 ac67612384334407abfbb13b6ecc0563
msgid ""
"Each per-asset panel shows the win/lose trade boxes and buy/sell markers "
"filtered to that asset's trades only."
msgstr ""
"每个资产面板上的赢/输交易框和买卖标记仅显示该资产自身的交易。"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:134 7695ebb950ee45719234798119d65686
msgid "Trade history"
msgstr "交易历史"

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:136 17f55d86384e466487dc47a34cb7a5eb
msgid ""
"`bt.get_trade_history()` returns a DataFrame with an `Asset` column so "
"you can filter or group by symbol downstream:"
msgstr ""
"`bt.get_trade_history()` 返回的 DataFrame 包含 `Asset` 列，方便后续按代码筛选或分组："
